scenario play is:
    the move jump with b, 2, "a", 3, d and 4 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move move with c, 3, b and 4 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move move with b, 4, "a" and 5 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move move with d, 4, c and 5 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move move with "a", 5, d and 6 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move jump with d, 2, "a", 3, b and 4 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move move with "a", 1, d and 2 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move move with "a", 3, d and 4 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move jump with c, 5, d, 6, "a" and 7 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move move with "a", 7, d and 8 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move move with d, 6, c and 7 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move move with c, 1, b and 2 is made from 12 to 13.

